{"symbol":"AASHKA","yahoo":"AASHKA.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Aashka Hospitals Limited","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","website":"https://www.aashkahospitals.in","about":"Aashka Hospitals Limited operates multi-disciplinary private hospitals, clinics, and pharmacies in India. The company offers anaesthesiology, cardiology, cardiothoracic and vascular surgery, critical care, dentistry, dermatology and cosmetology, ENT, emergency and trauma care, endoscopy, gastroenterology and gastroentero surgery, general and laparoscopic surgery, interventional radiology, medical and haemato oncology, nephrology and dialysis, neurology, neurosurgery, obstetrics and gynaecology, orthopedics and joint replacement, and ophthalmology services. It also provides physiotherapy and rehabilitation, plastic and reconstructive surgery, pediatrics and neonatology, psychiatry, pain management, pulmonology, radiology, surgical oncology, urology, pathology, infectious diseases, and diabetology and endocrinology services. In addition, the company offers internal medicine, including geriatrics; medical gastroenterology, such as hepatology. Aashka Hospitals Limited was incorporated in 2012 and is based in Gandhinagar, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:04:56+00:00","quote":{"price":88.5,"prevClose":84.9,"marketCap":207.09,"high52":99.5,"low52":59.0,"pe":61.89,"bookValue":44.13,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":3.29,"shares":2.34,"insiders":75.59,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2021-09-01","2021-09-02","2021-09-03","2021-09-06","2021-09-07","2021-09-08","2021-09-09","2021-09-13","2021-09-14","2021-09-15","2021-09-16","2021-09-17","2021-09-20","2021-09-21","2021-09-22","2021-09-23","2021-09-24","2021-09-27","2021-09-28","2021-09-29","2021-09-30","2021-10-01","2021-10-04","2021-10-05","2021-10-06","2021-10-07","2021-10-08","2021-10-11","2021-10-12","2021-10-13","2021-10-14","2021-10-18","2021-10-19","2021-10-20","2021-10-21","2021-10-22","2021-10-25","2021-10-26","2021-